<title>JAPAN: Moody's assigns A3 rating to GMAC's samurai bonds.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns A3 rating to GMAC's samurai bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Tuesday that it had assigned its A3 rating to General Motors Acceptance Corp's (GMAC) two samurai bond issues.</p>
<p>One issue is worth 20 billion yen with a due date of March 2002 and the other is a 36 billion yen yen/NZ$ dual currency samurai bond due in December 1998.</p>
</text>
